Package: FPGS
Title: Full Prognostic Score Methods for Causal Effect Estimation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chamika", "Porage",
           email = "chamika.porage@statistik.uu.se",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ingeborg", "Waernbaum",
           email = "ingeborg.waernbaum@statistik.uu.se",
           role = "aut")
    )
Description: Implements full prognostic score (FPGS) methods for causal
    effect estimation. The package provides methods for estimating the FPGS
    using regression and random forest approaches and for estimating average
    treatment effects using regression imputation, matching, stratification,
    and weighting estimators.
